sequenceDiagram
participant AI_Agent as AI Agent
participant VaultClient as DeepSecure CLI/VaultClient (Local)
participant Backend as DeepSecure Backend
participant Target as Target Application/Database
participant Verification as Verification Component (Target)

AI_Agent ->> AI_Agent: Need arises to access Target
AI_Agent ->> VaultClient: Request Ephemeral Credential (no --local)
VaultClient -->> VaultClient: Generate Ephemeral Key Pair (Agent)
VaultClient -->> VaultClient: Sign Ephemeral Public Key (Agent) locally
VaultClient ->> Backend: POST /v1/vault/credentials (Agent ID, PubKey, Signature, Scope, TTL)
Backend -->> Backend: Authenticate CLI token & retrieve Agent Public Key
Backend -->> Backend: Verify Signature on Agent's Ephemeral Public Key
Backend -->> Backend: Generate Cred ID & Credential structure
Backend -->> Backend: Store Credential record in DB
Backend ->> VaultClient: Return Credential structure (Cred ID, Agent ID, Ephemeral PubKey, Scope, Expiry)
VaultClient ->> AI_Agent: Credential structure & Ephemeral Private Key (Agent)
AI_Agent -->> AI_Agent: Securely hold Ephemeral Private Key in memory
AI_Agent ->> Target: Send request with Credential structure (no private key)
Target ->> Verification: Intercept request & extract Cred ID
Verification ->> Backend: GET /v1/vault/credentials/{cred_id}/verify
Backend -->> Backend: Validate Cred ID, check expiry, revocation, scope
Backend ->> Verification: Respond Credential status (Valid/Invalid/Unauthorized)
Verification -->> Verification: If valid, generate own ephemeral key pair
Verification -->> Verification: Compute shared secret using Agent's Ephemeral Public Key
Verification ->> AI_Agent: Send own ephemeral public key
AI_Agent -->> AI_Agent: Compute shared secret with Target's Ephemeral Public Key
AI_Agent ->> Target: Securely encrypted request (AES-GCM)
Target ->> AI_Agent: Securely encrypted response (AES-GCM)
AI_Agent -->> AI_Agent: Discard ephemeral keys & shared secret
Target -->> Target: Discard ephemeral keys & shared secret
